    "Every1032B original and complete organized source independently read. Face retains all six ordered constructors and DecidableEq/Repr deriving.",
    "The WHOLE Presentation retains side:Nat,sidePositive:0<side,sourceBitCount:Nat,cell:Face->Fin side->Fin side->Bool and exact sourceFits:sourceBitCount<=6*side*side. side0 is excluded but sourceBitCount0 remains allowed.",
